# LonePay frontend environment
#
# Base URL of the Laravel API. Leave this empty so the SPA calls the API on its
# own origin; next.config.ts proxies /api and /sanctum to Laravel. This is
# required for Sanctum's first-party cookie/CSRF flow (the XSRF-TOKEN cookie
# must be readable by the page and the session cookie must be same-site).
# Only set an absolute URL when the API is served from the same site as the SPA.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=